our 10Mbit/sec FDDI card
 DEC DEFPA (PDQ) FDDI Interface
by an 100Mbit/sec ethernet card
 DEC TULIP (10/100) Ethernet Interface

Now the machine runs up normally for between 10 to 60 minutes,
